<body>
    <h1>PRD UAM Intake Rules</h1>
    <div class=3D"Section1">
        <p>Conditional selection logic applicable based on selected feature=
s.</p>
<p>Feature grouping:</p>
<ol>
 <li data-uuid=3D"b8dd6e66-930a-4789-b578-5558371936bf">Features are organi=
zed into bundled and optional elections (See:&nbsp;<a class=3D"createlink" =
href=3D"/pages/createpage.action?spaceKey=3DCOMPASS&amp;title=3DFeature+Lis=
t+-+2026+Q4&amp;linkCreation=3Dtrue&amp;fromPageId=3D2789212462&amp;atl_tok=
en=3D5ce1c5780d7ff2d41aad75ca5713c114b04e0b8b">Feature List - 2026 Q4</a>)<=
/li>
 <li data-uuid=3D"20e6d079-8ca7-4086-afce-7f68279c6672">Bundled elections a=
llow for one election into multiple features, such as Asset Servicing / Tra=
ding Tools =3D Maturing Instruments, re-orgs, historical exchange rates, eq=
uity borrowing=20
  <ol>
   <li data-uuid=3D"fbee6d91-2906-4049-87cc-a081ec70b9ed">Still allow for o=
nward show/hide depending on feasibility</li>
  </ol></li>
 <li data-uuid=3D"351726b0-97f6-4798-8d42-f37cbbb55355">Optional elections =
such as Paper Upload, Data Export, Compass Legacy are individually elected<=
/li>
 <li data-uuid=3D"4fbf7bb8-8352-4aee-9864-b47138269de0">End client user adm=
in only available to FSS</li>
</ol>
<p>Prevention of over-provisioning:</p>
<ol>
 <li data-uuid=3D"e04fd663-d305-4ed5-b7d9-0d9bd3147b6d">"View" should be de=
faulted for all modules when selected to de-risk mis-assignment of actions<=
/li>
 <li data-uuid=3D"2fd4a8a6-9ff1-4d56-9bbb-888981412197">File upload tools a=
re only available for "firm-level access"</li>
</ol>
<p>Access fine-tuning:</p>
<ol>
 <li data-uuid=3D"67c6ef66-9a37-4a2d-80fc-6ba39e9eed84">Additional entitlem=
ents selectable e.g. DROP approver once control profile is selected</li>
 <li data-uuid=3D"9d23d746-998c-42da-baa8-d62dfbb70b2e">Sub-features such a=
s MF / EQ / GIC orders, or tax docs / trade confirms, require additional el=
ection</li>
 <li data-uuid=3D"b6d2fe8d-87ae-4b83-8b3b-a1e7835717fa">MF upload only elec=
table if single MF is elected</li>
</ol>
<p><br></p>
    </div>
</body>
